့် ထည့်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.02-S023_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.02-S024","kind":"main","cn":"别放香菜。","meaning_my":"နံနံပင် မထည့်ပါနဲ့။","audio_file":"04.01.02-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.02-S024_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我不吃香菜。","meaning_my":"နံနံပင် မစားဘူး။","audio_file":"04.01.02-S024_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.02-S025","kind":"main","cn":"能给我点辣椒酱吗？","meaning_my":"ငရုတ်သီးဆော့စ် နည်းနည်း ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.01.02-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.02-S026","kind":"main","cn":"有醋吗？","meaning_my":"ရှလကာရည် ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.01.02-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.02-S026_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有，在桌上。","meaning_my":"ရှိတယ်၊ စားပွဲပေါ်မှာ။","audio_file":"04.01.02-S026_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.02-S027","kind":"main","cn":"有酱油吗？","meaning_my":"ပဲငံပြာရည် ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.01.02-S027.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.02-S028","kind":"main","cn":"不要放味精。","meaning_my":"အချိုမှုန့် မထည့်ပါနဲ့။","audio_file":"04.01.02-S028.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.02-S029","kind":"main","cn":"味道刚刚好。","meaning_my":"အရသာ ကွက်တိပဲ။","audio_file":"04.01.02-S029.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.02-S030","kind":"main","cn":"味道怪怪的。","meaning_my":"အရသာ နည်းနည်း ထူးဆန်းနေတယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.02-S030.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S001","kind":"main","cn":"我不吃猪肉。","meaning_my":"ဝက်သား မစားဘူး။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S002","kind":"main","cn":"我不吃牛肉。","meaning_my":"အမဲသား မစားဘူး။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S003","kind":"main","cn":"我吃素。","meaning_my":"သက်သတ်လွတ်စားတယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有，我们有素菜。","meaning_my":"ရှိပါတယ်၊ သက်သတ်လွတ်ဟင်း ရှိပါတယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S003_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我不吃肉。","meaning_my":"အသား မစားဘူး။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S003_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S004","kind":"main","cn":"这个是素的吗？","meaning_my":"ဒါ သက်သတ်လွတ်ဟင်းလား။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S004_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我先帮你确认一下配料。","meaning_my":"ပါဝင်ပစ္စည်းတွေကို အရင် စစ်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S004_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S004_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这里面有肉吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီထဲမှာ အသား ပါလား။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S004_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S005","kind":"main","cn":"有素食菜单吗？","meaning_my":"သက်သတ်လွတ် မီနူး ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有，给你一份。","meaning_my":"ရှိပါတယ်၊ မီနူးတစ်စောင် ပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S006","kind":"main","cn":"可以不放猪肉吗？","meaning_my":"ဝက်သား မထည့်ဘဲ ချက်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S007","kind":"main","cn":"我对花生过敏。","meaning_my":"မြေပဲနဲ့ ဓာတ်မတည့်ဘူး။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S007_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我先问厨房用了什么。","meaning_my":"မီးဖိုချောင်မှာ ဘာတွေ သုံးထားလဲ အရင် မေးကြည့်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S007_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S007_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我对花生严重过敏，千万别放。","meaning_my":"မြေပဲနဲ့ ဓာတ်မတည့်တာ ပြင်းထန်လို့ လုံးဝ မထည့်ပေးပါနဲ့။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S007_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S008","kind":"main","cn":"我对海鲜过敏。","meaning_my":"ပင်လယ်စာနဲ့ ဓာတ်မတည့်ဘူး။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S009","kind":"main","cn":"我对鸡蛋过敏。","meaning_my":"ကြက်ဥနဲ့ ဓာတ်မတည့်ဘူး။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S010","kind":"main","cn":"我对牛奶过敏。","meaning_my":"နို့နဲ့ ဓာတ်မတည့်ဘူး။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S011","kind":"main","cn":"我对虾过敏。","meaning_my":"ပုစွန်နဲ့ ဓာတ်မတည့်ဘူး။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S012","kind":"main","cn":"我不能吃坚果。","meaning_my":"အခွံမာသီးတွေ မစားနိုင်ဘူး။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S013","kind":"main","cn":"我过敏很严重。","meaning_my":"ဓာတ်မတည့်တာ အရမ်း ပြင်းထန်တယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S013_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"那先别点这道菜，确认清楚再说。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို ဒီဟင်းကို အခု မမှာသေးနဲ့၊ သေချာ စစ်ပြီးမှ မှာရအောင်။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S013_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S014","kind":"main","cn":"这个里面有什么？","meaning_my":"ဒီအထဲမှာ ဘာတွေပါလဲ။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S014_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"里面有鸡蛋和牛奶。","meaning_my":"အထဲမှာ ကြက်ဥနဲ့ နို့ ပါတယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S014_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S015","kind":"main","cn":"里面放肉了吗？","meaning_my":"အထဲမှာ အသား ထည့်ထားလား။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S016","kind":"main","cn":"这个酱里有花生吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီဆော့စ်ထဲမှာ မြေပဲ ပါလား။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S016_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我帮你问一下厨房。","meaning_my":"မီးဖိုချောင်မှာ မေးပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S016_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S017","kind":"main","cn":"这道菜会用花生油吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်းမှာ မြေပဲဆီ သုံးလား။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S018","kind":"main","cn":"这里面有牛奶吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီအထဲမှာ နို့ ပါလား။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S019","kind":"main","cn":"麻烦确认一下有没有海鲜。","meaning_my":"ပင်လယ်စာ ပါမပါ သေချာ စစ်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S019_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好的，我去厨房确认。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်ကဲ့၊ မီးဖိုချောင်မှာ သေချာ သွားမေးပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S019_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S020","kind":"main","cn":"麻烦不要放海鲜。","meaning_my":"ပင်လယ်စာ မထည့်ပေးပါနဲ့။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S021","kind":"main","cn":"这口锅刚炒过海鲜吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီဒယ်အိုးနဲ့ ခုနက ပင်လယ်စာ ကြော်ထားသေးလား။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S021_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"刚炒过，可能还有残留。","meaning_my":"ခုနက ကြော်ထားတယ်၊ အကြွင်းအကျန် ရှိနေနိုင်တယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S021_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S022","kind":"main","cn":"这口锅接触过花生吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီအိုးမှာ မြေပဲပါတဲ့ဟင်း ချက်ဖူးလား။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S023","kind":"main","cn":"麻烦换一道没有花生的菜。","meaning_my":"မြေပဲမပါတဲ့ တခြားဟင်းတစ်ပွဲ ပြောင်းပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S023_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，但还得确认锅具有没有接触过花生。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ ဒါပေမဲ့ အိုးမှာ မြေပဲ ထိတွေ့ထားတာ ရှိမရှိ သေချာ စစ်ရဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S023_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.03-S024","kind":"main","cn":"我不能吃这个。","meaning_my":"ဒါ မစားနိုင်ဘူး။","audio_file":"04.01.03-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.04-S001","kind":"main","cn":"有什么推荐的？","meaning_my":"ဘာဟင်းကောင်းကောင်း အကြံပြုပေးမလဲ။","audio_file":"04.01.04-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.04-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"这是我们店的招牌菜。","meaning_my":"ဒါ ကျွန်တော်တို့ဆိုင်ရဲ့ နာမည်ကြ