_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.04-S013_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"今天这个卖完了。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ ဒီဟင်း ကုန်သွားပြီ။","audio_file":"04.01.04-S013_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.04-S014","kind":"main","cn":"那来一份这个吧。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို ဒါ တစ်ပွဲ ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.01.04-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.04-S015","kind":"main","cn":"先来这些，不够再加。","meaning_my":"ဒါတွေ အရင်မှာမယ်၊ မလောက်ရင် ထပ်မှာမယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.04-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.04-S016","kind":"main","cn":"这个和那个哪个好？","meaning_my":"ဒါနဲ့ ဟိုဟာ ဘယ်ဟာ ပိုကောင်းလဲ။","audio_file":"04.01.04-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.04-S017","kind":"main","cn":"有儿童餐吗？","meaning_my":"ကလေးစာ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.01.04-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.04-S018","kind":"main","cn":"这个适合小孩吃吗？","meaning_my":"ဒါ ကလေးတွေ စားဖို့ သင့်တော်လား။","audio_file":"04.01.04-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.04-S019","kind":"main","cn":"这个好吃。","meaning_my":"ဒါ အရသာရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"04.01.04-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.01.04-S020","kind":"main","cn":"有什么喝的推荐？","meaning_my":"သောက်စရာ ဘာကောင်းကောင်း အကြံပြုမလဲ။","audio_file":"04.01.04-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"}]}
